; M1A1 Bazooka placeholder viewmodel, assembled from primitives.
; Local space matches the other weapons: the tube points along -Z, +Y up.
; Roughly life-size (~1.25m of tube), most of which sits behind the shoulder.
;
; Its damage bands are far tighter than a rifle's -- 1, 3 and 9 yards out from
; the burst rather than 10, 50 and 250 downrange -- so it carries its own
; `band_yards` rather than the shared small-arms curve.
[gd_scene load_steps=26 format=3]

